<div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300">
    <p>Your account will become inactive immediately. You may recover it for up to 30 days unless you waive recovery. After the deadline, private recipes, plans, diary and target history, organisation, imports, exports, credentials and recovery attribution are permanently removed.</p>
    <p>Your name and profile will be removed from public meal plans. Public plans bookmarked by another user remain at existing links as unlisted plans attributed to “Former VibeDietr user.” They may be independently copied, cannot receive new bookmarks, and are permanently removed when the final bookmark is removed. Other plans become unavailable immediately.</p>
    <p>Recovery restores ownership, attribution and previous visibility, except for permanently removed plans. Their private consumption history remains private after recovery. Public recipes and shared catalogue facts remain anonymized after purge. Independently owned remixes and copies are unaffected.</p>
    <p>Documented legal or security holds preserve only specifically required evidence. Backups remain beyond normal use until verified expiry under the approved erasure schedule; restore controls must reapply deletion before release. These exceptions do not extend account recovery. Download your account export before requesting deletion.</p>
    <p>A sole administrator must have an active replacement before requesting deletion. Confirmed under-13 accounts are disabled and purged without recovery, and their public recipes and plans are removed.</p>
</div>
